{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8355a8207a800c91","name":"Martial Arts III","source":{"id":"source:reference-8355a8207a800c91","title":"Martial Arts III","revision":27082,"timestamp":"2025-08-07T11:20:04Z","sha256":"43df30a542174353e02962addca4cb51e51d05b46d2bbc7d89048a63c5d71687","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=27082","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Martial%20Arts%20III&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8355a8207a800c91","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your Martial Arts prowess is second to none. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +6, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_II","referenceId":"reference:7a2046d81777b063"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Damage dealt by your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," increases by one die step. In addition, you gain a +1 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (which stacks with the dodge bonuses granted by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_II","referenceId":"reference:7a2046d81777b063"}," feats).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," The amount of damage you deal with a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," attack is based on your size: Small, 1d3; Medium, 1d4; Large, 1d6.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," A situation that makes you lose your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (if any) also makes you lose any dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonuses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonuses"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Natural Weapons"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Saga Edition FAQ"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saga_Edition_FAQ"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q52:"]}," Do Natural Weapons (claws, bite, etc.) stack with the Martial Arts ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," in some way?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Martial Arts increases the damage die of a creature's natural attacks, just as it does for a creature's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},". For example, A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cathar","referenceId":"reference:c63ff0e21f96fa73"}," (claw attack, 1d6 damage) with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"}," would deal 1d8 damage with a claw attack whereas a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cathar","referenceId":"reference:c63ff0e21f96fa73"}," with ","Martial Arts III"," would deal 1d12 damage with a claw attack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
